# This directory is a workspace ROOT (pkg-index marker #2).
#
# phase-383 W10.a — needed because the cargo/cmake root here is now GENERATED
# under `build/<coord>/` and gitignored, so it is absent in a fresh clone and
# between builds. `detect_workspace_root` walks up for a `Cargo.toml` carrying
# `[workspace]` and otherwise falls back to `.git/`, so without this marker a
# package inside a migrated workspace resolves its root to the REPOSITORY and
# indexes every package in the tree:
#
#   nros::main!: build_pkg_index: duplicate pkg name `demo_bringup` in
#   workspace `/…/nano-ros`: `examples/templates/c-and-cpp-mixed-workspace/
#   src/demo_bringup` and `examples/templates/multi-node-workspace/src/demo_bringup`
#
# A workspace is a workspace whether or not anything has been built in it, so
# the marker is TRACKED and does not depend on build state.
